{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>If his master.</b> This teaches that his master has authority to give him a Canaanite maidservant to beget children from her when he is already married to an Israelite woman, but when he is not married he cannot compel him and give him one, as it is said: ״אם בגפו יבא בגפו יצא״. And the reason is that when he is married to an Israelite woman he will not be drawn after the maidservant, but when he is not married he will be drawn after her."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:33.660675541Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}